docs {
  Dashboard figures, windowed in the restaurant's own timezone -- a 1am order belongs
  to the previous evening's service (docs/DECISIONS.md D9).

  `avg_accept_secs` and `avg_fulfil_secs` are null when there is no data. That is deliberate: zero
  would claim orders are accepted instantly.
}
